    "identifier": "breath-of-wind-cutter",
    "description": "<p>You begin to collect wind release chakra until it spirals around the user’s weapon creating whipping torrents of wind. You use this enhanced field of wind to propel you towards your enemy with a circular strike</p>\n<p>Make a melee taijutsu attack comparing its results against all creatures within your weapons range, dealing your weapons damage + 1d8 wind damage.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Affected creatures must make a Dexterity saving throw, on a failed save, this attack Pierces 4 DR.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d4.</p>",
